    content:
    - You can now take a quest from the competitive quest board.
    - These quests are like normal quests, except that there'll be other adventurers
      trying to reach your target.
    - You only get one chance to complete them, so if they've got a reward you really
      want, make sure you're well-prepared.
    - This is the end of all the story content, but do give the competitive quests
      a try.
